<title>USA: Singapore cuts BISYS Group stake.</title>
<headline>Singapore cuts BISYS Group stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government of Singapore said Wednesday it reduced its stake in BISYS Group Inc to 159,060 common shares or 0.67 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Singapore said it sold a net of 1,054,200 shares of BISYS between July 9 and August 26 at prices ranging from $33.4219 to $38.00 a share.</p>
<p>Singapore holds the stake in the company for investment purposes.</p>
